 begin="1:05.978" end="1:09.322" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.978" end="1:08.685">犯了偷窃时间的</span><span begin="1:08.685" end="1:09.322">错</span></p><p begin="1:09.442" end="1:13.437" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.442" end="1:10.181">复</span><span begin="1:10.181" end="1:11.711">制贴上你</span><span begin="1:11.711" end="1:12.423">的</span><span begin="1:12.423" end="1:13.437">爱</span></p></div><div begin="1:13.829" end="1:36.725" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:13.829" end="1:19.269" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.829" end="1:15.382">也很精彩</span><span begin="1:15.382" end="1:16.873">的你</span> <span begin="1:16.873" end="1:17.514">不</span><span begin="1:17.514" end="1:18.347">甘寂</span><span begin="1:18.347" end="1:19.269">寞</span></p><p begin="1:19.743" end="1:25.443" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.743" end="1:21.270">这圈子不</span><span begin="1:21.270" end="1:22.736">太大</span> <span begin="1:22.736" end="1:23.494">多</span><span begin="1:23.494" end="1:24.323">少听</span><span begin="1:24.323" end="1:25.443">说</span></p><p begin="1:25.670" end="1:31.200" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.670" end="1:27.305">欣赏你流</span><span begin="1:27.305" end="1:27.977">浪</span> <span begin="1:28.599" end="1:30.202">像是种信</span><span begin="1:30.202" end="1:31.200">仰</span></p><p begin="1:31.652" end="1:36.725" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.652" end="1:33.267">我真这么</span><span begin="1:33.267" end="1:36.725">想</span></p></div><div begin="1:37.742" end="2:01.036" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:37.742" end="1:43.027" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.742" end="1:38.220">再</span><span begin="1:38.220" end="1:40.922">被你提起已是连</span><span begin="1:40.922" end="1:41.702">名</span><span begin="1:41.702" end="1:42.013">带</span><span begin="1:42.013" end="1:43.027">姓</span></p><p begin="1:43.489" end="1:49.145" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.489"